  <item>
    <title>当我们谈论爱时，爱到底是什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ee4aff87a9242776c6fac0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ee4aff87a9242776c6fac0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Sep 2024 04:26:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>爱，一个宏大的概念，也是我们一生的命题。它存在于万古不变的山河里，存在于点点滴滴的生活中，更是一针一线地串起了我们与一个个他者的关系。爱是一个中性词，它有时候代表幸福，有时候代表痛苦，但作为人类，我们又是如此离不开爱。这期节目，我们想聊一聊爱，听上去非常cliche，但我和小王都一致发现这是一个不可名状但却有许多可以聊的话题。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">1:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a>对爱的理解是私人的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a>爱的表现形式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>我们该如何爱？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a>为什么好像总是女性容易在爱中受伤？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a>题外话：一些影视剧爱情故事的讨论</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 爱的目的是成为自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a>爱是流动的，该如何应对变化</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> 爱的本质</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 爱不只是罗曼蒂克</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>开头bgm: What is love -- Twice</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>结尾bgm：一念之间 -- 告五人</span></strong></p>]]></description>
