    <title>《老友记》：友情的终极乌托邦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6587937acab6086ec139b289</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6587937acab6086ec139b289</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Dec 2023 02:12:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>今天我们friends大聊《Friends》，这部关于六个人十年友谊的电视剧曾一度创下全球收视纪录，而这一期我们就从《老友记》出发聊聊生命中的另一种爱，友情。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在本期节目你可以听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 迟到但不缺席，我们为什么突然开始看老友记？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 老友记讲了什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 什么是经典？为什么《老友记》能成为经典？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 永远的钱德勒，悼念马修·派瑞</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 与《老友记》中角色产生的连接感</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 我们的精神偶像：菲比</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 现实与《老友记》的差距</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2207">36:47</a> 成长过程中友情观的变化</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 那些渐行渐远的友谊（这是什么现实中的“闰土”和“迅哥儿”）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 总结</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3786">1:03:06</a> 小花絮：脑雾出现人传人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>*由于录制期间在外旅游，收音不好，小王在这里向您的耳朵致歉。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
