    <guid isPermaLink="false">656f94d3b4b5dd5510be975b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 17:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>咚锵咚锵，”失眠因子“第一期终于出炉啦！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>有情皆孽，今天这期让我们大聊情之一字! 谈谈现在的约会文化和这个恋爱我们真的非谈不可吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>看点在于本期节目的两个主播，一个是牡丹，另一个也是牡丹...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>在本期节目你可以听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 初入职场，在恋爱这件事上我真的落单了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 平辈压力与长辈压力双管齐下</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">8:45</a> 目前有想谈恋爱的想法吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 快餐约会文化 yes or no</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>如何认识新朋友：dating app有利弊</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 恋爱之前先了解自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> dating app故事会</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 两种男嘉宾如何选择？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 爱情是个谜，现实与理想大碰撞</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 性取向是流动的吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 姐的自信光芒在哪呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">1:12:00</a> 与自卑，焦虑和解的途径</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>人生漫漫，对于爱情的思考是个必修课。如果你关于恋爱有什么想分享的，欢迎在评论区留交流～～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>邮箱：ntsunrun@hotmail.com</span></strong></p>]]></description>
